# Poducator — secrets required by the Edge Function.
#
# This file documents WHICH secrets are needed. It never contains values, and
# no file in this repo ever should: the repository is public, so anything
# committed here is published, and git history keeps it published even after a
# later removal.
#
# Set these in the Supabase dashboard (Edge Functions → Secrets) or with:
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...

# Your Anthropic API key. Lives only in the function's environment — it is
# never sent to a browser and never appears in the client bundle. The function
# has no passphrase gate, so set a spend limit on this key in the Anthropic
# console — that is what bounds cost if the URL gets passed around.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
